### Neptune Industrial Thermal SaaS API Integration Suite
@host = http://localhost:3000

### 1. HEALTH AND READINESS
GET {{host}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. REGISTER A NEW DATA CENTER OWNER (Heat Producer)
# @name registerDC
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "producer@neptune.io",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "DATA_CENTER"
}

###

### 3. REGISTER A NEW DISTRICT HEATING UTILITY OWNER (Heat Buyer)
# @name registerBuyer
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "district@bhopalgrid.in",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "HEAT_BUYER"
}

###

### 4. LOGIN SECURELY TO THE PORTAL (Using Seed Account Credentials)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "teamashish2005@gmail.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Store the Bearer token returned from Login response to authenticate following endpoints.
@token = {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

###

### 5. RETRIEVE ALL SYSTEM FACILITIES (With profile & compliance detail overlays)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/facilities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 6. REGISTER A NEW HEAT PRODUCER FACILITY
# @name createDCFacility
POST {{host}}/api/v1/facilities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bhopal Edge Cloud Substation Delta",
  "type": "DATA_CENTER",
  "latitude": 23.2599,
  "longitude": 77.4126,
  "coolingSystemType": "Direct Liquid Immersion Chassis"
}

###

### 7. RUN COMPLIANCE RECALCULATION ON-DEMAND
POST {{host}}/api/v1/compliance/recalculate/dc-facility-1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 8. QUERY THE GEOSPATIAL MATCHMAKING ENGINE FOR LINKAGES
GET {{host}}/api/v1/matches/nearby?facilityId=dc-facility-1&radiusKm=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 9. BIND MATCH TO FORMAL FLOW CONTRACT (Accepting match-3)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/contracts/match-3/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pricePerGJ": "6.20"
}

###

### 10. GENERATE CRYPTOGRAPHIC CERTIFICATES BACKED CARBON CREDITS
POST {{host}}/api/v1/carbon-credits/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deliveryId": "c1-del-2"
}
